    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3369ef99e54947f5de60786e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线若位于前方\\n则稍微提升加速度\\n＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f9effca2d4e25d258f533ccfa4eb5f295b395a0e364bbcc709d2132c3f36d0",
